{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7000_situation", "source_sha256": "6ca68b16ae01705b86439f4cf00794bc601cf04ecd0ee2e97cbd5ceafed93d65", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "写真拍摄的工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7000_place", "source_sha256": "f1860edaa8a9578fc2484c89f70aff5f4be5b8e448a9efe39fa4812250ca02c2", "ja": "撮影スタジオ", "zh": "摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7001_p", "source_sha256": "408a37ce98845121c8d2c1ce593d9ee82870f34c9454036f30f26005f0639b87", "ja": "（今日は、グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\nそろそろエレナの支度も終わったかな……）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的拍摄日。艾丽娜也差不多准备好了吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7002_018ele", "source_sha256": "878c671989e4fc506dab2c54f2794c179a9826eb05aaad5537d03d1a08603bc9", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせ～！\nスタッフさんとイエティの話をしてたんだ。", "zh": "{$P$}，让你久等啦～！\n我刚才在和工作人员聊雪人呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7003_p", "source_sha256": "fcccbcd3b237e5bbbb5d30262a4bc91677ed1765e0d9fc25da2f868985299251", "ja": "そうだったのか。イエティは謎が多い生物だからな。\nそれでどんな話をしたんだ？", "zh": "原来是这样。雪人是一种充满谜团的生物呢。\n所以你们都聊了些什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7004_018ele", "source_sha256": "66a4c4e67eec12ae4ec994b2259406e1ff4490db5ea5eb908aea8a0e1565d487", "ja": "あのネ……イエティって人間にイタズラするみたい。\nもしかしたら、ひとりで寂しいのカナって。", "zh": "那个呀……雪人好像会恶作剧捉弄人类。\n我在想，它会不会是一个人太寂寞了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7005_018ele", "source_sha256": "7cf331856ab0e8fa552b4331b89671b42b30cbb1ba9754bd370dd9b90723d5eb", "ja": "ワタシなら、友達になって、そばにいてあげるのに！\n……どうしたら、イエティと仲良くなれるカナ～？", "zh": "如果是我的话，我会和它成为朋友，陪在它身边！\n……要怎么做才能和雪怪成为好朋友呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7006_p", "source_sha256": "aac7aa050c40d53774ce2d096261311e055126b3ad61666f3e45e6b670fd07a8", "ja": "イエティと仲良くなる方法か。\nそうだな……。", "zh": "和雪怪成为朋友的方法啊。\n这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7007", "source_sha256": "920651701d25b682e8a9493e05a85f7f651aca49c1c847d845838c6f152c96a3", "ja": "贈り物をする", "zh": "送礼物", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7008", "source_sha256": "4d759416c524e7c22bd856f0442523cd2356881b87341ce8b7ba9ec1d7ee7992", "ja": "ダンスを見せる", "zh": "展示舞蹈", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7200_p", "source_sha256": "9d40f6d5d95f4f146ab2f2dacff7b6bfc8c3a6b0a1ed558db9deb8d6fd63b633", "ja": "贈り物をするのはどうだ？　貰って嫌な人はいないし、\n仲良くなりたいアピールにもなると思うんだ。", "zh": "送礼物怎么样？没有人收到礼物会不高兴，\n而且我觉得也能表达出想搞好关系的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7201_018ele", "source_sha256": "84be1141ef9b72912c8e9057ff2a50e5c7b191626b26fb911aec3bb019f13254", "ja": "そっかー。ハッピーなサプライズってワケだネ♪\nイエティも笑顔になってくれたらいいナ。エヘヘ♪", "zh": "这样啊——也就是说，是开心的惊喜♪  \n要是连雪怪也能露出笑容就好了。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7202_018ele", "source_sha256": "64d3a30259fe0f9430ebf62cc201d31667d88f115ba31531a89cfee1a4262de2", "ja": "それならステキなプレゼント、考えなくっちゃ。\nワタシの気持ちがい～っぱい伝わるモノにしよっと♪", "zh": "那就得好好想想要送什么精彩的礼物了。\n要选一个能充分传达我心意的东西♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7300_p", "source_sha256": "9d40f6d5d95f4f146ab2f2dacff7b6bfc8c3a6b0a1ed558db9deb8d6fd63b633", "ja": "贈り物をするのはどうだ？　貰って嫌な人はいないし、\n仲良くなりたいアピールにもなると思うんだ。", "zh": "送礼物怎么样？没有人收到礼物会不高兴，\n而且我觉得也能表达出想搞好关系的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7301_018ele", "source_sha256": "825802d474c7b64aa4a792743f2c9ee3aec98ee0c6b739b01665f749d1ccb454", "ja": "そうかも！　……でも、イエティって何が好きかナ？\nスタッフさんも、そこまでは言ってなかったヨ～。", "zh": "也许吧！……不过，雪怪喜欢什么呢？工作人员也没说到那么详细哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7302_018ele", "source_sha256": "0710be8652d0eb4c573f910a18d8b778d46fa55b9e03f4d348b8cadb8e5d57e1", "ja": "あ、ブラジル料理～！　きっと、食べたことないよネ。\nエヘヘ……どんな顔するか楽しみだナ～♪", "zh": "啊，巴西料理～！它肯定没吃过吧。\n嘿嘿嘿……真期待看到它会露出什么表情呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7500_p", "source_sha256": "24114fa2c1ad6570ef38e8938b53c29eff38ad01c6db5d1e6c6c0a496eaf925e", "ja": "エレナのダンスを見せたらどうかな？　楽しい気持ちに\nなったら、イエティも心を開いてくれるかもしれない。", "zh": "要不要给它看艾莲娜跳舞呢？要是变得开心\n起来，雪人说不定也会向我们敞开心扉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7501_018ele", "source_sha256": "bc72cb60db0ce2a4ba7edb4f8c65ffd9ed74307afaaaaf7ed232f6823d2a18c3", "ja": "ナイスアイディアだヨ、{$P$}！\nワタシ、とっておきのステップ見せちゃうヨ～！", "zh": "这主意不错呀，{$P$}！  \n我给你展示我拿手的舞步哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7502_018ele", "source_sha256": "e335875cde98a676160042717e87abc1c78df4d5c6dd33b459378cdba06e77e0", "ja": "イタズラするヒマなんかないくらい、\n夢中にさせて、仲良しになっちゃうヨ♪", "zh": "让你入迷到连恶作剧的空闲都没有，和我成为好朋友吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7600_p", "source_sha256": "24114fa2c1ad6570ef38e8938b53c29eff38ad01c6db5d1e6c6c0a496eaf925e", "ja": "エレナのダンスを見せたらどうかな？　楽しい気持ちに\nなったら、イエティも心を開いてくれるかもしれない。", "zh": "要不要给它看艾莲娜跳舞呢？要是变得开心\n起来，雪人说不定也会向我们敞开心扉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7601_018ele", "source_sha256": "63f44fc92f534cc025c82d5101d06148232831e825cbba5b51b5386f90d74f01", "ja": "ダンスなら、ワタシに任せて！\nイエティはどんなダンスが好きかナ～？", "zh": "跳舞的话，就交给我吧！\n不知道雪怪喜欢什么样的舞蹈呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_7000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_7602_018ele", "source_sha256": "68fd3ddcb4c00fb3b6bccdbf0ad6c6e0a9881229680ba1b67fd86074e866865b", "ja": "イエティも、踊ってくれるかナ？\nサンバはやっぱり、一緒に踊らないとネ♪", "zh": "雪怪也会一起跳吗？\n桑巴果然还是要一起跳才行呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
